{"meta":{"id":"tt12100080","type":"movie","name":"Nadando con Delfines","imdb_id":"tt12100080","description":"Nadando con delfines narra la filmación de Delfines: La vida en el arrecife de Disneynature, la historia de una cría de delfín nariz de botella del Pacífico llamada Echo. Desde surfear con los delfines en Sudáfrica a bailar con ballenas jorobadas en Hawái, los cineastas llegan a grandes extremos (y profundidades) para arrojar una nueva luz sobre los misterios del océano. La exploradora Céline Cousteau es la narradora de la versión en inglés.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt12100080.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xd66XFtnvAEMK4zpisKIggGaQX0.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uCRLgPgPwgxIljvme0OdodGEZdG.png","genres":["Documental"],"releaseInfo":"2020","released":"2020-03-24T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"79 min","imdbRating":"7.0","country":"United States of America","cast":["Céline Cousteau"],"director":["Keith Scholey"],"trailers":[{"source":"RZQ_wpD5BLk","type":"Trailer","name":"Disneynature's Dolphins Official Trailer #1 (2017) Documentary Movie HD","ytId":"RZQ_wpD5BLk","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"RZQ_wpD5BLk","title":"Disneynature's Dolphins Official Trailer #1 (2017) Documentary Movie HD"}],"links":[{"name":"7.0","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt12100080"},{"name":"Documental","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Documental"},{"name":"Céline Cousteau","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=C%C3%A9line%20Cousteau"},{"name":"Keith Scholey","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Keith%20Scholey"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Céline Cousteau","character":"Narrator","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/fHVUaeOOXigPT5BxcufSRVKkZXZ.jpg","tmdbId":2587854}],"directors":[{"name":"Keith Scholey","photo":"htt